{"fields":[{"category":"项目参数","definition":"项目、料号、板号或客户项目编号。","field_code":"project_code","field_name":"项目编码","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"项目参数","definition":"项目或板件名称。资料没有独立名称时可暂缺，不用 `description` 顶替。","field_code":"project_name","field_name":"项目名称","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"项目参数","definition":"承接项目资料层面的说明、文件引用关系、设计资料指向和特殊解释规则；不承接板内生产参数和工艺要求。","field_code":"project_instructions","field_name":"项目指示","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"项目参数","definition":"承接资料登记、资料识别、参与分析、无法识别资料和暂不支持资料等项目处理层发现；用于追加多条处理说明，不承接板内生产参数、规则检查结论、报价或人工字段修改记录。","field_code":"project_analysis_findings","field_name":"项目处理发现","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"integration_only","unit":null},{"category":"项目参数","definition":"是否存在 Drill 文件或可解析钻孔资料。","field_code":"drill_file_presence","field_name":"Drill 文件存在性","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"integration_only","unit":null},{"category":"项目参数","definition":"是否存在 Gerber、GTD、Gerber Job 或可解析设计文件。","field_code":"gerber_job_presence","field_name":"Gerber 作业存在性","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"integration_only","unit":null},{"category":"项目参数","definition":"是否存在 XLSX 或其他结构化技术表。","field_code":"spreadsheet_presence","field_name":"技术表存在性","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"integration_only","unit":null},{"category":"项目参数","definition":"是否存在 PDF 图纸、规格书、钻孔表、图纸截图或客户补充图片；PDF 与图片进入同一 PDF/图片分析分支，第一版不单独设置 `image_presence`。","field_code":"pdf_presence","field_name":"PDF/图片资料存在性","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"integration_only","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"资料明确声明的 PCB 层数可以形成字段候选；GerberScout 只按已确认 copper role 的唯一 `copper_layer_index` 计数，Gerber 文件数量、解析文件数量不得直接作为 PCB 层数候选。","field_code":"layer_count","field_name":"PCB 层数","is_core":true,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"FR4、FR4-V0 等板材主体材料。","field_code":"base_material","field_name":"基材","is_core":true,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"只表示 PCB 成品总厚度；其他厚度或缺失说明不得顶替。","field_code":"board_thickness_mm","field_name":"成品板厚","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"外层铜厚独立字段，不和内层铜厚合并；固定以 `µm` 输出，资料中的 `um`、`μm`、`µm` 按微米单位规范化。","field_code":"outer_copper_thickness","field_name":"外层铜厚","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"µm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"内层铜厚独立字段，即使数值相同也不得复用另一来源；固定以 `µm` 输出，资料中的 `um`、`μm`、`µm` 按微米单位规范化。","field_code":"inner_copper_thickness","field_name":"内层铜厚","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"µm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"单片 PCB 成品尺寸的复合表达，不得被 panel、frame 或 Gerber bounds 覆盖。","field_code":"board_size_mm","field_name":"单板尺寸","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"单片 PCB 成品长度，单位统一为 mm。","field_code":"board_length_mm","field_name":"单板长度","is_core":true,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"单片 PCB 成品宽度，单位统一为 mm。","field_code":"board_width_mm","field_name":"单板宽度","is_core":true,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"panel、frame、usable area 等拼板或工艺边尺寸。","field_code":"panel_size_mm","field_name":"拼板尺寸","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"PDF 图纸中 panel 可用区域的尺寸。","field_code":"usable_area_mm","field_name":"可用区域尺寸","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"GerberScout 联合当前 job 中未忽略 Gerber 图形层得到 `{min_x, min_y, max_x, max_y}`；不包含 Drill-only 坐标，只作为工具测量结果，不等同单板尺寸或 panel 尺寸。","field_code":"gerber_bounds_mm","field_name":"Gerber 作业外框","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"PDF panel layout 和 XLSX 矩阵信息都可进入该字段；多来源表达可合并摘要，不直接判冲突。","field_code":"panelization_summary","field_name":"拼板摘要","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"V-cut、scoring、铣边、break tab 等机械加工说明。","field_code":"mechanical_process","field_name":"机械加工","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"PDF 图纸出现 fiducial marks 时记录。","field_code":"fiducial_mark_requirement","field_name":"Mark 点要求","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"PDF 图纸出现 break-point 示例或结构时记录。","field_code":"break_point_requirement","field_name":"断点要求","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"可来自 GerberScout 对已确认铜层且覆盖完整的几何测量；unsupported primitive 或部分覆盖只能形成不可靠候选或缺值诊断，与最小线距分开。","field_code":"min_trace_width_mm","field_name":"最小线宽","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"可来自结构化资料，也可来自 GerberScout 对已确认铜层且覆盖完整的最小铜间距测量；与最小线宽分开。","field_code":"min_trace_spacing_mm","field_name":"最小线距","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"客户资料声明的最小成品孔径，不等同钻孔尺寸全集。","field_code":"min_finished_hole_size","field_name":"最小成品孔径","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"钻孔表或 GerberScout 中实际 hit 引用的普通圆孔 tool 尺寸集合；未使用 tool、slot 和 route 不进入该字段。","field_code":"drill_size_list","field_name":"钻孔尺寸列表","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"钻孔表或 GerberScout 中各普通圆孔尺寸对应的实际 hit 数量；必须与 `drill_size_list` 使用同一 hit 集合，不等同订单生产数量。","field_code":"drill_quantity_list","field_name":"钻孔数量列表","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"槽孔、长圆孔或 routing slot 的宽、长和数量集合；GerberScout 只承接稳定解析的 slot/route，不能把普通圆孔或文件名猜测写入该字段；含义仍无法判断时作为未知说明保留。","field_code":"slot_size_list","field_name":"槽孔尺寸列表","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"钻孔表 `PLTD` 等字段，或 GerberScout 从 GTD、Drill 属性、X2/X3 文件功能元数据得到的明确金属化信息；文件名猜测不能形成候选。","field_code":"plated_hole_requirement","field_name":"金属化孔要求","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"NPTH、hole not plated，或 GerberScout 从 GTD、Drill 属性、X2/X3 文件功能元数据得到的明确非金属化信息；文件名猜测不能形成候选。","field_code":"non_plated_hole_requirement","field_name":"非金属化孔要求","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"通孔、盲孔、埋孔等孔类型语义；不接收孔径列表。","field_code":"via_type_summary","field_name":"孔类型摘要","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"是否存在盲孔及相关说明。","field_code":"blind_vias","field_name":"盲孔要求","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"是否存在埋孔及相关说明。","field_code":"buried_vias","field_name":"埋孔要求","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"GerberScout 从实际 hit 引用的普通圆孔 tool 中取得最小直径；未使用 tool、slot 和 route 不参与最小值。","field_code":"min_hole_diameter_mm","field_name":"工具测得最小孔径","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"GerberScout 在已确认铜层与 drill role 间形成稳定 pad/drill 关联后测得的候选；关联覆盖不足时只能形成不可靠候选或缺值诊断。","field_code":"min_annular_ring_mm","field_name":"最小环宽","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":"mm"},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"HASL、ENIG、OSP 等表面处理。","field_code":"surface_finish","field_name":"表面处理","is_core":true,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"TOP、BOT 或双面阻焊要求；GerberScout 只根据已确认的 `top_solder_mask`、`bottom_solder_mask` role 形成候选。","field_code":"solder_mask_layers","field_name":"阻焊层面","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"阻焊油墨颜色。","field_code":"solder_mask_color","field_name":"阻焊颜色","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"TOP、BOT 或双面字符要求；GerberScout 只根据已确认的 `top_silkscreen`、`bottom_silkscreen` role 形成候选。","field_code":"silkscreen_layers","field_name":"字符层面","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"丝印或字符颜色。","field_code":"silkscreen_color","field_name":"字符颜色","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"IPC Class 或制造等级。","field_code":"ipc_class","field_name":"IPC 等级","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"RoHS 合规要求。","field_code":"rohs","field_name":"RoHS 要求","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"UL94 V-0 等阻燃等级。","field_code":"ul_flame_class","field_name":"UL 阻燃等级","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"UL 认证最高工作温度。","field_code":"ul_max_operating_temperature","field_name":"UL 最高工作温度","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"branch_or_integration","unit":null},{"category":"板件设计参数","definition":"最终项目数据列表中的未知说明行。无法归入既有字段但有生产意义的参数、工艺、备注或其他说明，以及资料中只有字段名称和占位表达而没有真实工程值的内容，由整合阶段按稳定遍历顺序生成 `unknown_note_001`、`unknown_note_002` 等独立行；分支阶段不得预分配该最终编码。","field_code":"unknown_note_###","field_name":"未知说明","is_core":false,"producer_scope":"integration_only","unit":null}],"schema_version":"1.0"}